{"id":"steam-810030","steam":810030,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Waldenses: In Search of Truth","summary":"Enzo, a young man raised by his uncle, lives a peaceful life in the Piedmontese Alps, until rumors of a great evil coming from Rome at the behest of Innocent 8th come to light. The boy is involved in a great journey of faith in which friends will help him to try to avoid a terrible massacre.","about":"In the Piedmontese Alps, in northwest Italy from 1488, there are many villages, mounds and caves. It is there that Enzo lives, a young man traumatized by having lost his parents in one of the invasions made to the region, he is faced with rumors of a great evil coming from Rome. Furthermore, he has serious doubts about his faith, which is why these invasions have been repeated for decades. Now Enzo launches himself on a quest full of adventures, dramas, mysteries, learning, conflicts and friendships in an attempt to prevent a terrible massacre.\r\n\r\nYou will find in this game:\r\n\r\n1 - Captivating characters, with the possibility to play their flashbacks.\r\n2 - Setting in the mountains, caves, towns and cities.\r\n3 - Fictional characters, but situated in a historical context.\r\n4 - Songs made especially for the game.\r\n5 - Deepening in themes of the biblical Christian faith.\r\n6 - Hidden items and secret areas in different maps.\r\n7 - Main and side quests and achievements using the quest book.\r\n8 - Biblical studies held in churches in the villages and in special places, totaling 25 topics.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810030/library_600x900.jpg?t=1679067917","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810030/header.jpg?t=1679067917","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810030/library_hero.jpg?t=1679067917","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/810030/header.jpg?t=1679067917","backgr